sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 家长(Android)
    participant P as ParentPremiumPage
    participant C as AlipayUnlockController
    participant A as AlipayApiClient
    participant S as Server FastAPI
    participant DB as SQLite orders/code_pool
    participant B as AlipayBridge+Plugin
    participant AP as 支付宝 App
    participant AL as 支付宝网关
    participant E as RedeemCodeActivator
    participant ST as SecureEntitlementStore

    U->>P: 点「支付宝购买 ¥49.90」
    P->>C: start(deviceHash, appVersion)
    C->>C: phase = awaitingPayment
    C->>A: createOrder("android", appVersion, deviceHash)
    A->>S: POST /v1/order/create {platform,app_version,device_hash}
    S->>DB: 查码池 available>0? 否则 503
    S->>S: alipay.build_order_string(out_trade_no,"49.90") RSA2 签名
    S->>DB: INSERT orders(status='pending', claim_token)
    S-->>A: 200 {out_trade_no,claim_token,order_string,amount,expires_in}
    A-->>C: CreateOrderData
    C->>C: PendingOrderStore.save(pending)
    C->>B: pay(order_string)
    B->>AP: PayTask.payV2(orderStr,true)
    U->>AP: 输入密码确认付款
    AP->>AL: 提交交易
    AL-->>AP: 支付结果
    AP-->>B: resultStatus=9000/8000/...
    B-->>C: AlipayPayResult

    par 服务端异步确认（唯一可信付款证明）
        AL->>S: POST /v1/alipay/notify (form)
        S->>S: RSA2 验签 + app_id/amount/trade_status/seller_id
        S->>DB: UPDATE status pending→paid (CASE/COALESCE 幂等)
        S-->>AL: 纯文本 success
    and 客户端同步结果（仅作信号，不作发货依据）
        C->>C: _onPayResult: 9000/8000/6004/6006/5000 → paidAwaitingCode
        loop 7s 间隔，最多 12 次
            C->>A: redeem(out_trade_no, claim_token)
            A->>S: GET /v1/order/redeem
            S->>DB: hmac 校验 claim_token
            alt 已有码（幂等回读）
                DB-->>S: redeem_code, serial
                S-->>A: 200 {status:issued, redeem_code, serial}
            else 已付款未发码
                S->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE → _claim_and_bind()
                DB-->>S: code + serial
                S-->>A: 200 {status:issued, redeem_code, serial}
            else 回调未到
                S-->>A: 202 {status:pending}
            else 超时/未付
                S-->>A: 200 {status:unpaid}
            end
            A-->>C: RedeemData
        end
    end

    alt status == issued
        C->>C: phase = issuing
        C->>E: activate(redeem_code)
        E->>E: Ed25519 离线验签(既有 RedeemCodeVerifier)
        E->>ST: write(Entitlement.lifetime(redeemSerial:serial), jws:null)
        ST-->>E: ok / throw
        E-->>C: activated / alreadyPremium / failed
        alt activated 或 alreadyPremium
            C->>C: phase = (alreadyPremium ? duplicate : unlocked)
            C->>C: PendingOrderStore.clear()
            C-->>P: AlipayUnlockResult.unlocked
            P->>P: entitlementProvider 刷新 → 「已解锁」
        else 验签/落库失败
            C->>C: phase = paidAwaitingCode, 保留 pending
            C-->>P: 「稍后重试或联系我们」
        end
    else status == pending (轮询未结束)
        C->>C: 保持 paidAwaitingCode，提示稍后重试
    else status == unpaid
        C->>C: phase = expired，提示重新下单
    end

    Note over C,DB: 重复回调：notify 重放 → status CASE 不降级；<br/>重复 redeem → WHERE redeem_code IS NULL 回读同一码；<br/>重复 activate → alreadyPremium 不写票据 ⇒ 三重幂等
